@startuml
title UC2 - Book Appointment

start

:1. Select service, date, and time;
:2. Submit booking request;

if (3. Is slot available?) then (Yes)
  :4. Create appointment;
  :5. Show confirmation;
else (No)
  :6. Show unavailable message;
endif

stop

note right
Activity Description:

1. Customer selects service, date, and time.
2. Customer submits the booking request.
3. System checks availability of the selected slot.
4. If available, the system creates the appointment.
5. System displays booking confirmation.
6. If not available, system shows an error message.
end note

@enduml